{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026s24WXh8gb71794441342.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>原油期貨價格從兩個月低位反彈，因為伊朗表明，不會允許任何濃縮鈾材料運出境外，令外界對美伊緊張局勢緩和期望蒙上陰影。</p><p></p><p>紐約期油收市報86.53美元一桶，升49美仙，升幅百分之0.5。倫敦期油收市報92.76美元一桶，升1.27美元，升幅近百分之1.4。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T00:46:41.881308+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T23:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T05:29:48.776706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T00:39:58.672840+00:00","content_hash":"ae74c659da14fe02e2069c09b937d94cbed4b9518189f291a3de7425746ecbb3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T00:46:41.881308+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}